00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:24.250
Whatever rodent, I don't know if it was a rat, a squirrel, a mouse, whatever, has been eating away at my engine.
不管是哪种啮齿动物，我不知道是老鼠、松鼠还是小老鼠，反正它们一直在啃我的发动机。

256
00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:32.270
