00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:37.130
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

259
00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.590
And rodents love soy.
而啮齿动物最喜欢大豆了。

260
00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.330
So now it's a thing.
所以现在这成了个普遍现象。

261
00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:41.250
Rodent damage.
啮齿动物破坏。

262
00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:46.890
I couldn't believe it when you called me about this and told me that rodents had eaten your engine.
你打电话告诉我啮齿动物啃了你的发动机时，我简直不敢相信。

263
00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:47.470
Yes.
对。

264
00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.810
Thousands of dollars of damage, guys.
几千美元的损失，伙计们。

265
00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.130
Thousands of dollars of damage.
几千美元的损失。

266
00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:52.750
I still don't have my car back.
我的车到现在还没拿回来。

267
00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:58.970
