00:42:12.400 --> 00:42:13.280
him just a high five.
跟他击个掌。

998
00:42:15.160 --> 00:42:19.640
This is when Dwight says, hey, maybe you should put on a tie because David Wallace is going
这个时候德怀特说，嘿，你或许该系个领带，因为大卫·华莱士

999
00:42:19.640 --> 00:42:20.460
to be here in an hour.
一个小时后就要到了。

1000
00:42:20.620 --> 00:42:23.260
And Andy's like, oh, yeah, that's actually why I came back.
然后安迪说，哦，对哦，其实我就是为此才回来的。

1001
00:42:23.400 --> 00:42:26.080
I mean, and also to surprise Aaron.
我的意思是，同时也是为了给艾伦一个惊喜。

1002
00:42:26.600 --> 00:42:26.860
Oh, Andy.
哦，安迪。

1003
00:42:27.440 --> 00:42:27.920
Ugh.
呃。

1004
00:42:28.740 --> 00:42:34.020
This is when Clark is like, why are you looking forward to this meeting with David Wallace?
这时候克拉克就说，你为什么这么期待跟大卫·华莱士开会？

1005
00:42:34.400 --> 00:42:38.460
Isn't Wallace just going to, like, yell at you because you've been gone for three months?
华莱士难道不会因为你离职了三个月而冲你大吼大叫吗？

1006
00:42:38.980 --> 00:42:42.840
