然后大家就说，等等，大卫·华莱士知道你离职了吧？

1007
00:42:43.020 --> 00:42:46.380
And this is when Andy shares that actually he kept in touch with David Wallace.
接着安迪就透露说，其实他一直跟大卫·华莱士保持着联系。

1008
00:42:46.500 --> 00:42:47.760
He emailed him all the time.
他经常给他发邮件。

1009
00:42:48.000 --> 00:42:51.020
He would get high-speed internet at this cafe.
他会在这个咖啡馆连高速网络。

1010
00:42:51.640 --> 00:42:55.400
Aaron has a talking head where she says he only emailed me four times.
艾伦有个访谈镜头，她说他总共只给我发了四封邮件。

1011
00:42:56.580 --> 00:42:56.760
Yeah.
是啊。

1012
00:42:57.100 --> 00:42:58.080
That stings.
真扎心。

1013
00:42:58.420 --> 00:43:00.580
Andy notices that Pam and Jim are gone.
安迪发现帕姆和吉姆不在。

1014
00:43:00.740 --> 00:43:02.640
He has another snark remark about it.
他又对此冷嘲热讽了一句。

1015
00:43:02.640 --> 00:43:07.240
And Oscar is like, I find it curious that you're concerned about people's absence from work.
然后奥斯卡就说，我觉得奇怪的是，你竟然关心别人旷工。

1016
00:43:07.420 --> 00:43:09.220
This is a great Oscar snark.
奥斯卡这句讽刺太棒了。

1017
00:43:09.420 --> 00:43:10.120
Thank you, Oscar.
谢谢你，奥斯卡。

1018
00:43:10.600 --> 00:43:15.260
Back at the restaurant, Brian is now sharing kind of about how him and Alyssa just drifted apart.
回到餐厅，布莱恩现在开始聊起他和艾莉莎是怎么渐行渐远的。

1019
00:43:15.460 --> 00:43:21.220
And he said something I thought was great, which is he said it's when they stopped fighting that he knew it was over.
他说了句我觉得很棒的话，他说当他们不再争吵的时候，他就知道一切都结束了。

1020
00:43:21.720 --> 00:43:21.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1021
00:43:22.240 --> 00:43:24.140
And he gets really emotional.
然后他变得非常情绪化。

1022
00:43:24.320 --> 00:43:25.400
He kind of starts crying.
他有点开始哭了。

1023
00:43:25.840 --> 00:43:30.120
And he says, Pam, we have to stop breaking down in front of each other.
他说，帕姆，我们别再当着彼此的面崩溃了。

1024
00:43:30.460 --> 00:43:31.740
And Jim's like, what?
吉姆就问，什么？

1025
00:43:32.640 --> 00:43:36.100
And then he says, at least my crying won't get you fired.
然后他说，至少我哭不会害你被解雇。

1026
00:43:36.440 --> 00:43:37.840
And Jim's like, whoa, whoa, whoa?
吉姆就说，哇，哇，哇？

1027
00:43:38.240 --> 00:43:39.220
Pam was crying?
帕姆哭了？

1028
00:43:39.280 --> 00:43:39.760
What?
什么？

1029
00:43:40.000 --> 00:43:41.760
I thought, what?
当时我想，什么？

1030
00:43:43.180 --> 00:43:45.440
Well, here's my bulls**t card for Brian.
好吧，这是我对布莱恩亮出的胡扯牌。

1031
00:43:45.720 --> 00:43:46.460
What is it?
是什么？

1032
00:43:46.780 --> 00:43:48.820
He knew that Jim didn't know.
他明知吉姆还不知道这事。

1033
00:43:49.420 --> 00:43:49.920
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1034
00:43:50.480 --> 00:43:52.800
I know what you're doing, Brian, and stop it.
我知道你在搞什么鬼，布莱恩，别这样。

1035
00:43:53.280 --> 00:43:53.600
Ooh.
噢。

1036
00:43:53.980 --> 00:43:54.340
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1037
00:43:54.580 --> 00:43:55.620
Angela's not a fan.
安吉拉可不吃这一套。

1038
00:43:55.880 --> 00:43:56.120
Yeah.
对啊。

1039
00:43:56.300 --> 00:43:57.760
You're trying to drive a wedge here.
你想在这里挑拨离间。

1040
00:43:57.760 --> 00:44:02.060
You're trying to find an intimate moment with Pam in front of Jim.
你想在吉姆面前和帕姆制造亲密时刻。

1041
00:44:02.300 --> 00:44:02.780
Not cool.
太逊了。

1042
00:44:02.920 --> 00:44:03.440
Not cool.
太逊了。

1043
00:44:03.780 --> 00:44:06.320
This is when you're allowed to turn on Brian, everyone.
各位，这时候你们可以开始讨厌布莱恩了。

1044
00:44:06.580 --> 00:44:06.780
Yeah.
没错。

1045
00:44:07.000 --> 00:44:07.500
I think.
我是这么觉得的。

1046
00:44:08.220 --> 00:44:13.000
Listen, at 9 minutes and 35 seconds, I need to talk about the woman over Brian's shoulder.
听着，在9分35秒的时候，我得聊聊布莱恩肩膀后面的那个女人。

1047
00:44:13.000 --> 00:44:27.060
Through this whole emotional discussion, there is a woman over Brian's shoulder who full-on puts her fork into her food, lifts it up to her mouth.
在这整段充满情绪的对话中，布莱恩身后有个女人把叉子直直插进食物里，送到了嘴边。

1048
00:44:27.140 --> 00:44:27.720
What is it?
那是什么？

1049
00:44:27.780 --> 00:44:28.760
What is she lifting up?
她到底夹起了什么？

1050
00:44:28.760 --> 00:44:29.380
Nothing.
什么都没有。

1051
00:44:29.820 --> 00:44:30.120
What?
什么？

1052
00:44:30.120 --> 00:44:31.880
There's nothing on her fork.
她的叉子上什么都没有。

1053
00:44:32.140 --> 00:44:35.780
And then she, like, mimes eating nothing off her fork.
然后她，就好像，假装从空叉子上吃东西。

1054
00:44:36.440 --> 00:44:36.880
Nothing.
什么都没有。

1055
00:44:37.480 --> 00:44:38.240
Oh, my gosh.
噢，天哪。

1056
00:44:38.340 --> 00:44:39.640
I cannot wait to go check that out.
我等不及要去看看了。

1057
00:44:39.720 --> 00:44:40.240
It's crazy.
太疯狂了。

1058
00:44:40.400 --> 00:44:42.940
