所以我当时就想，难道他们没给这些人真正的食物吗？

1059
00:44:43.360 --> 00:44:44.800
Was she forced to do this?
她是被人逼着这么做的吗？

1060
00:44:44.900 --> 00:44:51.640
But then, if you look at the woman over Pam's shoulder, she puts food on her fork and eats it.
但如果你看潘肩膀后面的那个女人，她往叉子上放了食物并吃下去了。

1061
00:44:51.820 --> 00:44:54.300
I think that lady just didn't want to eat the prop food.
我觉得那位女士只是不想吃道具食物。

1062
00:44:54.540 --> 00:44:55.440
I think she didn't want it.
我觉得她不想要。

1063
00:44:55.900 --> 00:44:57.900
And I was like, good for you.
当时我就想，干得漂亮。

1064
00:44:57.900 --> 00:45:03.100
So, well, remember how I said that there was more Jim and Pam stuff in the script?
所以，对了，还记得我说过剧本里有更多吉姆和潘的戏份吗？

1065
00:45:03.460 --> 00:45:03.660
Yeah.
对。

1066
00:45:04.080 --> 00:45:05.100
There was more here.
这里还有更多。

1067
00:45:05.720 --> 00:45:07.840
There's also more later in the parking lot.
停车场后面也还有更多。

1068
00:45:07.980 --> 00:45:08.640
We'll get to it.
我们待会儿会讲到。

1069
00:45:08.760 --> 00:45:09.040
Okay.
好的。

1070
00:45:09.820 --> 00:45:13.520
But here's how the scripted scene read in the shooting draft.
但正式拍摄剧本里的这一场戏是这样的。

1071
00:45:13.740 --> 00:45:17.120
Okay, so the scene at lunch would have continued, like Brian is still sitting there?
好的，所以午餐的那场戏本该继续，就像布莱恩还坐在那里？

1072
00:45:17.200 --> 00:45:17.560
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1073
00:45:17.780 --> 00:45:18.020
Okay.
好吧。

1074
00:45:18.760 --> 00:45:19.460
Oh, man.
天哪。

1075
00:45:19.460 --> 00:45:20.300
And you know what?
你知道吗？

1076
00:45:20.380 --> 00:45:23.480
I'm glad they didn't include it because I think people would have lost their minds.
我很高兴他们没有把这个剪进去，因为我觉得大家会疯掉的。

1077
00:45:24.220 --> 00:45:25.860
I do not remember this.
我不记得这个了。

1078
00:45:26.260 --> 00:45:26.960
All right.
好吧。

1079
00:45:26.960 --> 00:45:29.500
In the shooting draft, it read like this.
在拍摄剧本中，它是这样写的。

1080
00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:32.020
At least my crying won't get you fired.
至少我哭不会害你被解雇。

1081
00:45:32.480 --> 00:45:33.340
Jim says, crying?
吉姆说，哭？

1082
00:45:33.680 --> 00:45:39.060
And then Brian would have gone on to say, and it says in parentheses, Brian, thinking he's
然后布莱恩会接着说，括号里写着，布莱恩自以为

1083
00:45:39.060 --> 00:45:44.900
funny, says, and neither of you is trying to hug me, so maybe I should have kept my hands
很幽默地说，而且你们两个又都没想要抱我，所以也许我该管好自己的

1084
00:45:44.900 --> 00:45:45.800
to myself, huh?
手，对吧？

1085
00:45:46.280 --> 00:45:49.000
Then Jim says, where were your hands?
然后吉姆说，你的手放哪了？

1086
00:45:50.160 --> 00:45:51.780
Then Jim looks to Pam.
然后吉姆看着潘。

1087
00:45:52.060 --> 00:45:55.220
Pam sighs, knowing they are about to get into it.
潘叹了口气，知道他们又要开始争执了。

1088
00:45:56.100 --> 00:45:56.360
Wow.
哇。

1089
00:45:56.740 --> 00:45:57.220
Yeah!
是啊！

1090
00:45:58.240 --> 00:45:58.760
Wow.
哇。

1091
00:45:59.360 --> 00:45:59.780
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1092
00:46:00.540 --> 00:46:02.360
Probably good that they didn't keep that in.
没把这段保留下来大概是件好事。

1093
00:46:02.440 --> 00:46:02.900
Good trim.
剪得好。

1094
00:46:02.900 --> 00:46:10.560
Well, we're going to leave Jim and Pam in their awkward moment and go back to Dunder Mifflin.
好了，我们要把吉姆和潘留在他们尴尬的时刻，回到邓德米夫林。

1095
00:46:10.660 --> 00:46:16.200
We're going to go to Andy's office where he's coming down on Dwight for not running the Scranton
我们要去安迪的办公室，他正在训斥德怀特，怪他在向安迪报备

1096
00:46:16.200 --> 00:46:20.760
White Pages account details by Andy before offering such a low price point.
斯克兰顿白页网的账户细节之前，就给出了这么低的报价。

1097
00:46:21.600 --> 00:46:25.540
And so he's like, I'm sorry, I'm going to need to call the White Pages.
所以他就说，抱歉，我得给白页网打个电话。

1098
00:46:26.100 --> 00:46:27.660
