And he makes his own applause sound.
接着他自己配起了掌声。

1127
00:47:42.720 --> 00:47:43.180
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1128
00:47:43.980 --> 00:47:46.360
Angela sits with silent rage.
安吉拉默默地坐在那里怒火中烧。

1129
00:47:48.800 --> 00:47:53.580
And then the scene would have continued as scripted, and it said in the notes, when
然后场景本应按照剧本继续演下去，剧本备注里写着，当

