Nobody wants to be the one to, like, rat out Andy, I guess.
我想谁都不想当那个去向安迪告密的人吧。

1150
00:48:45.840 --> 00:48:46.180
Yeah.
是啊。

1151
00:48:46.300 --> 00:48:48.020
And Dwight says, I'd like to rat out Andy.
而德怀特说，我想去告安迪的发。

1152
00:48:48.220 --> 00:48:53.080
Unfortunately, I have a bit of a boy-who-cried-wolf dynamic with David Wallace, except instead of
不幸的是，我和大卫·华莱士之间有点像“狼来了”的信任危机，只不过

1153
00:48:53.080 --> 00:48:54.040
a boy, I am a man.
我不是男孩，我是个男人。

1154
00:48:54.160 --> 00:48:57.240
And instead of a wolf, I cried genetically-engineered monster wolf.
而且我喊的不是狼，而是基因改造的怪物狼。

1155
00:48:57.660 --> 00:48:58.820
So Dwight can't do it.
所以德怀特自己不能去。

1156
00:48:58.920 --> 00:48:59.780
Dwight can't do it.
德怀特不能去。

1157
00:48:59.780 --> 00:49:04.700
Well, Andy's going to come in the break room now, and there's one section of this
好了，现在安迪要走进休息室了，这段对话里有

