It is Jake Lacey when Meredith is going on and on, where she's talking about how, like,
那是杰克·莱西的反应，当时梅雷迪思喋喋不休，说诸如

1160
00:49:12.700 --> 00:49:14.620
there are many things you can call me.
有很多外号都可以叫我。

1161
00:49:15.040 --> 00:49:17.040
Floozy, Alky, Einstein.
荡妇、酒鬼、爱因斯坦。

1162
00:49:17.480 --> 00:49:18.140
Vomit mop.
呕吐拖把。

1163
00:49:18.340 --> 00:49:19.040
Floor meat.
地上的肉。

1164
00:49:19.400 --> 00:49:21.620
Flesh hoover, but never a narc.
吸肉机，但绝不能叫告密者。

1165
00:49:21.740 --> 00:49:24.860
I love when Jake is like, why does no one stop her?
我太喜欢杰克那种“为什么没人阻止她”的表情了。

1166
00:49:25.200 --> 00:49:26.600
Why does no one stop her?
为什么没人阻止她？

1167
00:49:26.780 --> 00:49:27.780
It's so good.
太棒了。

1168
00:49:27.920 --> 00:49:28.460
It's really funny.
真的很好笑。

1169
00:49:28.900 --> 00:49:32.780
This moment in this scene also drove home for me, something that I've wanted for a
这场戏里的这个瞬间也让我深刻意识到了一件我渴望了

1170
00:49:32.780 --> 00:49:33.220
long time.
很久的事。

1171
00:49:33.380 --> 00:49:38.180
I'm a fan of the show, Abbott Elementary, and I have always wanted them to have Kate Flannery
我是电视剧《小学风云》的粉丝，我一直希望他们能让凯特·弗兰纳里

1172
00:49:38.180 --> 00:49:40.640
come on and play Melissa's sister.
来客串梅莉莎的姐妹。

1173
00:49:40.860 --> 00:49:45.800
Melissa is like the brassy teacher on Abbott Elementary, and I don't know why.
梅莉莎是《小学风云》里那个性格泼辣的老师，我也不知道为什么。

1174
00:49:45.920 --> 00:49:50.880
And the thing is, is like, she has a sister, but she's played by someone else, but she needs
关键是，她确实有个姐妹，不过是别人演的，但她需要

1175
00:49:50.880 --> 00:49:52.900
another sister played by Kate Flannery.
另一个由凯特·弗兰纳里扮演的姐妹。

1176
00:49:53.480 --> 00:49:54.600
This is my feeling.
这就是我的直觉。

1177
00:49:54.780 --> 00:49:57.260
You heard it here, Abbott Elementary producers.
《小学风云》的制片人们，你们听到这话了吧。

1178
