00:50:07.420 --> 00:50:08.960
somehow related to that family.
不知怎么跟那家人沾亲带故。

1181
00:50:09.020 --> 00:50:11.040
I don't know if we can do that crossover.
我不知道我们能不能搞这种联动。

1182
00:50:11.500 --> 00:50:14.900
Aaron is now just going to suggest that they let Andy get himself in trouble.
亚伦现在要建议让他们看着安迪自己惹麻烦。

1183
00:50:15.080 --> 00:50:16.780
I mean, look at how he looks.
我的意思是，看看他那个样子。

1184
00:50:16.900 --> 00:50:19.720
Wallace is going to take one look at him and know that something is off.
华莱士只要看他一眼，就知道不对劲了。

1185
00:50:19.720 --> 00:50:27.300
